==German==

===Etymology===
From {{compound|da|mit|lang=de}}. Compare {{cog|en|theremid}}, {{m|en|therewith}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/daˈmɪt/|lang=de}} {{qualifier|generally}}
* {{IPA|/ˈdaːmɪt/|lang=de}} {{qualifier|the adverb, when stressed}}
* {{audio|De-damit.ogg|Audio|lang=de}}

===Adverb===
{{de-adv}}

# ''pronominal adverb of'' '''{{l|de|mit}}'''

===Conjunction===
{{head|de|conjunction}}

# {{lb|de|subordinating}} [[so]] [[that]], [[in order]] [[that]]
#: ''Beeil dich, '''damit''' wir bald losfahren können.''
#:: Hurry up so that we can take off soon.

====Synonyms====
* {{l|de|dass}} {{qualifier|chiefly in colloquial usage}}

